AyatFlow speech model (whisper-small-ar-quran-q8_0.bin)

This file is a modified (format-converted and 8-bit quantised) copy of:

  deepdml/whisper-small-ar-quran-mix-norm
  https://huggingface.co/deepdml/whisper-small-ar-quran-mix-norm
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

which is a fine-tuned version of OpenAI Whisper (small), MIT licence:
  https://github.com/openai/whisper

Conversion and quantisation used whisper.cpp (MIT licence):
  https://github.com/ggml-org/whisper.cpp

Changes: weights converted to the whisper.cpp ggml file format and quantised to q8_0; the decoder
context length in the header was set from the checkpoint's max_target_positions (448).

